New enumerator to get the ranges (boundaries) of the tokens.

```csharp
var example = "Hello and good day to you";
var words = Tokenizer.GetWords(example);
var ranges = words.Ranges;

foreach (var range in ranges) {
    var word = example[range];
}

```

